<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">Notes :-  n  n(1)The above results have been reviewed by Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors in its meeting held on 13th November , 2019.  n  n(2) For the above result, Limited review report has been issued by Statutory Auditors on 13th November , 2019.  n  n(3) In line with IND AS -108  Operating Segments , the Company’s business activity falls within a single primary business segment viz. “Manufacturing of Specialty Chemicals”.  n  n(4) The Company has adopted IND AS 116- Leases using modified retrospective approach from 01st April 2019. Accordingly, comparatives have not been retrospectively adjusted. The adoption of IND AS 116 doesn't have any material impact on the standalone results for the quarter and Six months ended 30th September, 2019.  n  n(5) On 20th September, 2019, vide the Taxation Laws (Amendment) Ordinance 2019, the Government of India has inserted section 115BAA in the Income Tax Act, 1961 which provides Domestic companies an option to pay corporate tax at reduced rate effective from 01st April, 2019. These Financial Statements are prepared on the basis that the Holding Company would avail the option to pay income tax at the lower rate. Consequently, the Holding Company has remeasured its current tax expenses and deferred tax basis the rate prescribed in the aforesaid section. The impact of this change has been recognised in the statement of profit and loss for the quarter and six months ended 30th September, 2019  n  n(6)  Previous year’s/period's figures have been regrouped and / or rearranged wherever considered necessary.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
